_struct.pdbx_model_details
;This model was generated unsupervised by the SWISS-MODEL homology-modelling pipeline for the SWISS-MODEL Repository, a database of annotated 3D protein structure models. The modelled monomer covers following UniProtKB entries:

  - A0A096MYY1/ A0A096MYY1_PAPAN, Signal peptide peptidase like 3
  - A0A0D9S4L7/ A0A0D9S4L7_CHLSB, Signal peptide peptidase like 3
  - A0A2K5CMY3/ A0A2K5CMY3_AOTNA, Signal peptide peptidase like 3
  - A0A2K5N6D5/ A0A2K5N6D5_CERAT, Signal peptide peptidase like 3
  - A0A2K5W529/ A0A2K5W529_MACFA, Signal peptide peptidase like 3
  - A0A2K6BP08/ A0A2K6BP08_MACNE, Signal peptide peptidase like 3
  - A0A2K6PZU3/ A0A2K6PZU3_RHIRO, Signal peptide peptidase like 3
  - A0A2K6SES5/ A0A2K6SES5_SAIBB, Signal peptide peptidase like 3
  - A0A5F7ZCR7/ A0A5F7ZCR7_MACMU, Signal peptide peptidase like 3
  - A0A6J3EUI4/ A0A6J3EUI4_SAPAP, Signal peptide peptidase-like 3 isoform X2
  - A0A6P5PRU3/ A0A6P5PRU3_MUSCR, Signal peptide peptidase-like 3
  - A0A8C6GWG7/ A0A8C6GWG7_MUSSI, Signal peptide peptidase 3
  - A0A8C9J7I9/ A0A8C9J7I9_9PRIM, Signal peptide peptidase like 3
  - A0A8D2G242/ A0A8D2G242_THEGE, Signal peptide peptidase like 3
  - A0A8I3W687/ A0A8I3W687_CALJA, Signal peptide peptidase like 3
  - A0ABQ0ET22/ A0ABQ0ET22_APOSI, Signal peptide peptidase-like 3
  - A0ACF8HPZ4/ A0ACF8HPZ4_SEMEN, Uncharacterized protein
  - A0ACF8PM90/ A0ACF8PM90_NASLA, Uncharacterized protein
  - G2HHD7/ G2HHD7_PANTR, Signal peptide peptidase-like protein 3
  - H2NIW8/ H2NIW8_PONAB, Signal peptide peptidase like 3
  - H2Q720/ H2Q720_PANTR, Signal peptide peptidase like 3
  - H9EPH2/ H9EPH2_MACMU, Signal peptide peptidase-like 3
  - Q8TCT6/ SPPL3_HUMAN, Signal peptide peptidase-like 3
  - Q9CUS9/ SPPL3_MOUSE, Signal peptide peptidase-like 3
  - U3BVW1/ U3BVW1_CALJA, Signal peptide peptidase-like 3

Estimated model accuracy of this model is 0.541, calculated by SWISS-MODEL as Global Model Quality Estimate (GMQE).
;
